                            "_type": "Product Edition",
                            "namespace": "28d06644e2f84b398c1b7fb96a2b6bd5",
                            "description": "Viva as provações de oito guerreiros em sua luta para livrar a humanidade do controle divino enfrentando legiões de feras nos reinos de cada deus. ",
                            "offerId": "5207cdd79e9145d0bbb947c6bd3699a3",
                            "tag": "edition",
                            "title": "Gods Will Fall",
                            "slug": "product/gods-will-fall/home"
                        },
                        {
                            "regionRestrictions": {
                                "_type": "Store Region Filtering"
                            },
                            "image": {
                                "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/gwf-ve-layered-key-art-final-1920x1084-589474045.png",
                                "_type": "Diesel Image"
                            },
                            "_type": "Product Edition",
                            "namespace": "28d06644e2f84b398c1b7fb96a2b6bd5",
                            "description": "The gods’ torturous rule over humanity has lasted for millennia. Bent on cruelty, they demand to be served with blind worship through an oath of fealty pledged from every man, woman and child. To those who don't submit to the gods’ will; a merciless death awaits.\nExperience the brutal trials of a venturous band of warriors in their desperate plight to sever the gods’ callous grip on humanity. Every man and woman who can muster a blade, having suffered the brutality of the gods’ reign for too long, will be called upon to form your clan of 8 Celtic survivors and rise up to take on the legions of horrific beasts and minions that dwell in each of the gods’ hellish realms.   \nSucceed and see legends born. Fail, and watch lives turn to dust.\n\n\n# The Valiant Edition Includes \"The Valley of the Dormant Gods\"",
                            "offerId": "ecbb654bd93a4ca7bf33bd4394cf5671",
                            "tag": "edition",
                            "title": "Gods Will Fall: Valiant Edition",
